1
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,857
Two rings filled with a fatal poison have

2
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:08,297
been implanted around
JoJo's neck and heart.

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,597
Neither can be removed.

4
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:12,157
Before the rings dissolve
and the poison is released,

5
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:16,240
JoJo must defeat the powerful Wamuu
in order to secure the antidote.

6
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,220
What was I thinking?

7
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:26,677
When I said I needed a month,
I only meant it as a bluff.

8
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,995
I didn't think he'd take me seriously.

9
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:30,917
I should have said I needed a year.

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,480
A tip for you, Jojo.

11
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:35,897
Quit screwing around and act like a man!

12
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:38,277
We need to think of something, and fast!

13
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:40,020
I know, this is how I think.

14
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:44,277
But there really isn't any point
in thinking about this too hard.

15
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:48,478
If we do that, we'll realize just
how much trouble we're both in here.

16
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:50,657
Once you're done with your thinking,

17
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:54,297
Freakout, I want you to pay close
attention to what I'm about to do here.

18
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,210
Huh?

19
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:01,160
The water's suspended in mid-air!

20
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:03,560
Jojo, catch!

21
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:05,977
Try to keep the water
in the glass like that.

22
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:06,890
Easy!

23
00:01:06,973 --> 00:01:08,200
I can do that, no sweat!

24
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:14,549
Here's what you did wrong.

25
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:18,037
The strength of your hamon is
pretty much equivalent to mine.

26
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:23,061
But you waste a lot of your power because
you release it from the palm of your hand.

27
00:01:23,180 --> 00:01:26,400
And thus, you can't
control the water. However,

28
00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:31,360
when I hold the water, I release Hormone
from the tip of one of my fingers,

29
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:32,780
a single point.

30
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:37,700
That method allows me to focus my energy,
making it easy to control the water.

31
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:43,035
Scattering Hormone everywhere the way
you do just disperses your energy.

32
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:45,857
Think of it like using
a squirt gun with its

33
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:48,397
smaller hole rather
than an open water hose,

34
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,310
capiche?

35
00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:52,920
You're naturally gifted, Jojo,

36
00:01:53,180 --> 00:01:56,377
but you need a lot of work to
get your Hamon under control.

37
00:01:56,460 --> 00:02:00,519
I brought you to Venice to meet my
mentor, but it's gonna be a grind.

38
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,030
Oh no!

39
00:02:02,113 --> 00:02:06,766
Grind and work are probably my two least
favorite words in the English language.

40
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,670
Thank

41
00:02:25,753 --> 00:02:26,583
you

42
00:02:26,666 --> 00:02:32,260
so

43
00:02:46,260 --> 00:02:48,780
much for watching.

44
00:03:00,260 --> 00:03:03,060
Thank you.

45
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:20,677
I want to be with the world.

46
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:22,677
I'll see you in the dark.

47
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:24,231
I'll see you in the dark.

48
00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:28,357
I'll see you

49
00:03:28,440 --> 00:03:35,440
in

50
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:38,910
the

51
00:03:38,993 --> 00:03:39,823
dark.

52
00:03:39,906 --> 00:03:40,736
The world is so far.

53
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:50,900
doing in a place like this?

54
00:03:53,460 --> 00:03:54,300
Excuse me.

55
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:58,882
Do you know Air Saplina Island and
how long it takes to get there?

56
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,828
Gondolier, did you hear me?

57
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:22,340
Oh, how is he standing
on that oar like that?

58
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:25,300
I don't think I like this, not one bit.

59
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:32,920
The hell?

60
00:04:38,660 --> 00:04:40,040
You asked for it.

61
00:04:40,540 --> 00:04:44,481
I have no idea who you are, but
I'm going to make you pay for that.

62
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:46,855
You're going to wish you never met me.

63
00:04:47,420 --> 00:04:51,157
At least he can control his Hamon
well enough to stand on water.

64
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,122
That's a start.

65
00:04:55,540 --> 00:04:56,440
A woman?

66
00:04:57,260 --> 00:04:58,720
Is that you, coach?

67
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:01,580
She goes by the name of Lisa Lisa.

68
00:05:01,980 --> 00:05:04,804
Nobody knows her true
name, her place of origin,

69
00:05:05,020 --> 00:05:08,117
where she studied, or how she
mastered the art of Hamon.

70
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:12,965
She will be JoJo's coach for as long as
it takes, or at least for the next month.

71
00:05:13,220 --> 00:05:14,057
Well, well.

72
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:17,777
Don't think that I'll forgive you for
hitting me in the face with that oar.

73
00:05:17,860 --> 00:05:21,957
Just because you're a girl doesn't mean
that I won't give you what you deserve.

74
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:26,377
You should just be happy that you impressed
me with your initial display of skills.

75
00:05:26,460 --> 00:05:31,401
Walking on water when you obviously lack
proper training is quite an accomplishment.

76
00:05:32,820 --> 00:05:36,160
However, if you truly wish
to master Hormone in a month,

77
00:05:36,380 --> 00:05:38,660
you must be prepared to die for it!

78
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:40,870
See?

79
00:05:40,953 --> 00:05:42,520
She's using the oar as a high bar!

80
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,400
What is this?

81
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,160
Joseph Joestar.

82
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:05,157
From this moment forward, you will be
wearing that breathing correction apparatus.

83
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,534
until I say otherwise.

84
00:06:07,580 --> 00:06:09,120
I can't breathe!

85
00:06:09,300 --> 00:06:10,957
Not without proper rhythm, you can't.

86
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:14,397
However, with proper breath
control, you'll have no problem.

87
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:17,637
If you do not maintain proper
breath control, then yes,

88
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:20,900
the mask will eventually
suffocate you. So, focus.

89
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:25,737
Learn to master your breath and you'll
be running marathons while wearing it.

90
00:06:25,820 --> 00:06:26,800
Are you crazy?

91
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:29,353
Get this damn thing off my face right...

92
00:06:30,060 --> 00:06:31,537
I can't breathe!

93
00:06:31,620 --> 00:06:34,297
You do realize your
training has already begun.

94
00:06:34,380 --> 00:06:37,937
You can take the mask off for meals and
whenever you need to brush your teeth.

95
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:40,217
Jojo, don't make it hard on yourself.

96
00:06:40,300 --> 00:06:43,476
Just keep your rhythm and
pretend that it's Halloween.

97
00:06:44,180 --> 00:06:45,677
I'm gonna get you, lady.

98
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:47,257
And one more thing before I forget.

99
00:06:47,340 --> 00:06:48,977
So we're both on the same page.

100
00:06:49,060 --> 00:06:51,417
I did not accept the
responsibility of training

101
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:53,757
you just so that you
can save your own skin.

102
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:58,060
I am forging a squad of warriors
capable of annihilating our enemies.

103
00:06:58,380 --> 00:06:59,800
You witch!

104
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,310
Careful.

105
00:07:01,393 --> 00:07:03,359
You want another Grand with her?

106
00:07:03,860 --> 00:07:05,540
I would never hit a woman.

107
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,504
It's always a pleasure, Caesar.

108
00:07:08,660 --> 00:07:09,840
And you, Jojo.

109
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:11,540
Welcome to Venice.

110
00:07:14,180 --> 00:07:15,010
Shuichi.

111
00:07:15,093 --> 00:07:17,357
It can't help but respect
her harmon skills.

112
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:20,317
But good luck finding anyone
who would ever marry her.

113
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:22,340
Even if she is kinda cute.

114
00:07:23,460 --> 00:07:24,660
Bow when she leaves.

115
00:07:24,860 --> 00:07:25,977
Are you kidding me?

116
00:07:26,060 --> 00:07:30,377
Italy's most transparent playboy wants
me to be polite to that little witch.

117
00:07:30,460 --> 00:07:31,737
Watch your tongue, Jojo.

118
00:07:31,820 --> 00:07:33,761
I respect her like my own mother.

119
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,217
She'll have the same respect.

120
00:07:35,300 --> 00:07:36,300
I'm warning you.

121
00:07:37,580 --> 00:07:42,077
Air Saplina Island is about 30
minutes northeast of Venice by boat.

122
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:46,537
Its mysterious air is a stark
contrast to the city of canals.

123
00:07:46,620 --> 00:07:51,017
But it possesses a dark beauty that
seems to be a perfect fit for Lisa Lisa.

124
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:53,517
This is your new training ground, Jojo.

125
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:56,840
I have claimed that
entire island as my home.

126
00:07:57,540 --> 00:08:00,557
So this is where I'll have
to die for my Hamon training.

127
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:02,600
We'll just see about that.

128
00:08:05,940 --> 00:08:10,997
So I see, I'm glad you're
safe and my grandson too.

129
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:13,820
I don't know if I've ever been happier.

130
00:08:18,140 --> 00:08:21,977
Hey, if you mention one word about
those stupid poison rings to granny,

131
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:23,417
I'll beat you senseless.

132
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:25,912
It would do no good to tell her anything.

133
00:08:28,820 --> 00:08:31,217
No sense wasting any more of my time.

134
00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:34,917
I hope you're ready for the
hell climb pillar. Wait.

135
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,437
Seriously, what's the big deal?

136
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:38,637
But but coach,

137
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:42,237
you know that I haven't even made an
attempt on hell climb pillar right?

138
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:45,037
Do you really intend
for us to start on this?

139
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:47,857
So many have died on hell climb pillar.

140
00:08:47,940 --> 00:08:49,457
I've heard countless stories.

141
00:08:49,540 --> 00:08:52,397
Stories that may or may not be true.

142
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:54,797
If you fail, you have no place here.

143
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:55,817
Hello?

144
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:58,457
Would somebody care to clue
me in on what's going on?

145
00:08:58,540 --> 00:09:01,037
This hell pillar thing doesn't
really look all that tall.

146
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:04,580
Well, from up here, it's
really more deep than tall.

147
00:09:05,980 --> 00:09:06,897
Go to it.

148
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:08,380
Please don't do this.

149
00:09:15,580 --> 00:09:17,437
What the hell is this?

150
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:22,397
Oh yeah, this pillar is
covered in flowing oil.

151
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:27,245
It's 24 meters to the top of the pillar
and you may only use your hands to climb.

152
00:09:27,340 --> 00:09:28,940
There is no other way out.

153
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:33,080
If you can't find a way to climb
back, you'll die down there.

154
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:35,360
But that's impossible!

155
00:09:35,660 --> 00:09:38,836
There's no way that anyone
could climb up that pillar!

156
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:59,865
JoJo and Caesar must now overcome the most
grueling of all Hamon endurance tests,

157
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,580
the Hell Climb Pillar.

158
00:10:04,740 --> 00:10:06,200
This is really bad.

159
00:10:06,460 --> 00:10:08,540
I can barely cling to the pillar,

160
00:10:08,780 --> 00:10:12,140
and moving my fingers even a
little bit is so exhausting.

161
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:16,837
If I were to fall now, I wouldn't have
anything left to start climbing again,

162
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:19,155
but I can't think like that right now.

163
00:10:19,420 --> 00:10:22,832
Otherwise, Jojo and I will
both starve to death down here.

164
00:10:25,220 --> 00:10:26,050
Jojo!

165
00:10:26,133 --> 00:10:29,037
The longer you stay in that muck,
the harder it is to climb out.

166
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:30,020
Now focus!

167
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:31,470
No!

168
00:10:31,553 --> 00:10:33,320
I must stay focused on myself.

169
00:10:35,180 --> 00:10:38,480
I can't get distracted,
not even for a second.

170
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:44,320
This is ridiculous!

171
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:46,397
I just got here!

172
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:50,117
That smug witch knows I'm not
strong enough to climb this stupid,

173
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,906
stupid, stupid, stupid thing!

174
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,440
It's not fair!

175
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:57,957
Just who the hell does she think she
is anyway, throwing us down this hole?

176
00:10:58,040 --> 00:11:01,275
There's no way I could possibly
respect her after this!

177
00:11:01,420 --> 00:11:03,997
I've always been patient
when it comes to women,

178
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:07,997
but she'd better start praying that
I never make it out of here alive!

179
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:09,120
Bloody hell!

180
00:11:13,220 --> 00:11:17,800
So this idiotic pillar claimed the lives
of a lot of trainees is that right?

181
00:11:19,220 --> 00:11:23,632
Maybe they were all just too dimwitted
to come up with a creative solution!

182
00:11:30,540 --> 00:11:33,277
Using anything but hormone
is an insult to the

183
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:36,037
pillar and your training
the hell climb pillar.

184
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:37,597
Lisa only accepts Hormone.

185
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:39,280
It refuses anything else.

186
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:41,220
So don't ever forget that.

187
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:44,480
Wait a sec, come back, Lisa-Lisa!

188
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,420
I mean, coach, wait!

189
00:11:48,940 --> 00:11:51,357
You wouldn't really leave
me down here to rot?

190
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,837
Just because I don't have enough power!

191
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,802
to climb out of here, would you?

192
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:56,760
I mean, it's my first day.

193
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:59,197
This is just some kind of test, right?

194
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,515
To teach me humility?

195
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:02,197
You'll pull me out later, right?

196
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:03,110
Right?

197
00:12:04,420 --> 00:12:05,250
Huh?

198
00:12:08,260 --> 00:12:09,860
Her eyes are like ice.

199
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,460
She really means it.

200
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:14,092
She's just going to let me die down here.

201
00:12:14,580 --> 00:12:15,410
Curse her!

202
00:12:15,540 --> 00:12:17,497
What gives her the right to do this?

203
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:20,017
The fact that she's so
damn beautiful just makes

204
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:22,688
me even more furious
about this whole thing!

205
00:12:28,700 --> 00:12:33,817
28 hours later, Caesar is at 15
meters, while Jojo is at 0 meters.

206
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:36,720
The rings will now dissolve in 28 days.

207
00:12:37,580 --> 00:12:39,757
I'm pretty sure we've
been in here overnight,

208
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:42,958
and Caesar still has a long
way to go up that pillar.

209
00:12:43,140 --> 00:12:47,552
I should be focusing on myself, but I
can tell that he's really struggling.

210
00:12:49,740 --> 00:12:52,217
His fingers look like
they're about to come loose.

211
00:12:52,300 --> 00:12:55,535
If he loses that grip, he's
going to come sliding down.

212
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:58,097
His hormone looks like
it's about to run out.

213
00:12:58,180 --> 00:12:59,360
Caesar, focus!

214
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:08,620
Oh, he looks like he's
about to fall again.

215
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:11,740
He's hanging by his fingertips. Caesar!

216
00:13:15,620 --> 00:13:16,760
Oh, wait a second.

217
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:19,177
Is that how he's been
climbing this entire time?

218
00:13:19,260 --> 00:13:21,554
By using just his fingertips like that?

219
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:25,860
He wasn't about to fall off at all.

220
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,437
He was just...

221
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:30,777
Think of it like using a squirt
gun with its smaller hole.

222
00:13:30,860 --> 00:13:31,690
That's...

223
00:13:31,773 --> 00:13:32,603
that's it!

224
00:13:32,700 --> 00:13:34,288
It totally makes sense now!

225
00:13:39,180 --> 00:13:41,560
Consider this hormone mystery solved!

226
00:13:43,220 --> 00:13:44,960
Let's see how this works!

227
00:13:48,940 --> 00:13:50,700
I did it! It's working!

228
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:53,096
My hormone is sticking to the pillar!

229
00:13:53,300 --> 00:13:55,600
All this time I had my hands flat.

230
00:13:55,940 --> 00:13:58,117
I was trying to use them
to support my weight,

231
00:13:58,200 --> 00:14:00,671
when in fact it's the opposite that works.

232
00:14:01,140 --> 00:14:05,397
Focused Hamon concentrated into the
fingertips is where the true strength lies.

233
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:07,068
What a simple little trick.

234
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,141
I've got it now.

235
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:11,165
All I have to do from
here on up is just climb.

236
00:14:11,740 --> 00:14:14,820
And plot my revenge on
that so-called Hamon coach.

237
00:14:16,260 --> 00:14:18,300
JoJo's got it. Good for him.

238
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:21,500
Another 24 hours have passed.

239
00:14:21,980 --> 00:14:23,580
Caesar is now at 18 meters.

240
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:25,860
And JoJo is at 16 meters.

241
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:29,000
The rings will dissolve
in exactly 27 days.

242
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:31,410
Oh, boy.

243
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:36,426
Now I can see why Caesar started to slow
down so much once he got to this point.

244
00:14:36,700 --> 00:14:40,000
The pillar begins curving
outward here as it goes up.

245
00:14:40,280 --> 00:14:42,457
This is where things
are going to get tough.

246
00:14:42,540 --> 00:14:45,599
The pillar is as unforgiving
as that damn Lisa Lisa.

247
00:14:47,140 --> 00:14:49,060
It is now, three hours later.

248
00:14:49,500 --> 00:14:51,000
Caesar is at 19 meters.

249
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:52,840
Jojo at 18 meters.

250
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,637
Oh, is that a...

251
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:56,960
Yes, it is. It's a crack.

252
00:14:57,140 --> 00:14:59,897
And it should be just big
enough for my fingers.

253
00:14:59,980 --> 00:15:00,862
Thank goodness.

254
00:15:01,100 --> 00:15:03,100
Time for a well-earned break here.

255
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:06,380
I can't believe my luck.

256
00:15:07,060 --> 00:15:09,766
Things are finally
starting to look up for me.

257
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,760
Oh, no! What was that?

258
00:15:12,940 --> 00:15:14,881
It felt like some kind of switch.

259
00:15:16,380 --> 00:15:17,800
Did you feel that, Jojo?

260
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:20,640
What's going on? What the? Oh, no.

261
00:15:21,780 --> 00:15:24,580
The Hellclimb Pillar only accepts Hormone.

262
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:26,360
It refuses anything else.

263
00:15:27,760 --> 00:15:28,590
Watch out!

264
00:15:28,673 --> 00:15:29,503
What?

265
00:15:29,586 --> 00:15:30,416
Something's happening!

266
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:33,070
Not good.

267
00:15:33,180 --> 00:15:35,768
I must have tripped
some sort of booby trap.

268
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:38,437
This just went from
difficult to impossible.

269
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:41,777
How in the world are we supposed
to scale this thing now?

270
00:15:41,860 --> 00:15:45,457
An impenetrable sheet of oil shoots
out of the pillar at a deadly speed,

271
00:15:45,540 --> 00:15:46,893
near the 20-meter mark.

272
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:59,202
That stream is so highly pressurized
that it can cut like a razor!

273
00:16:00,140 --> 00:16:00,970
What?

274
00:16:01,053 --> 00:16:02,497
Stop looking at me like that!

275
00:16:02,580 --> 00:16:03,517
It was an accident!

276
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:04,953
You can't be mad at me!

277
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,420
Look, I'm sorry, okay?

278
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:12,657
I was just trying to rest for a second.

279
00:16:12,740 --> 00:16:14,677
I did what any other sane
person would have done.

280
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:18,940
Whatever madman designed this
diabolical thing, set that up as a trap.

281
00:16:19,800 --> 00:16:22,271
I wasn't giving you a look of blame, Jojo.

282
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:24,442
I was giving you one of concern.

283
00:16:25,140 --> 00:16:27,777
I'm not even sure if
I can focus my hormone

284
00:16:27,860 --> 00:16:30,448
enough to get through
that oil in one piece.

285
00:16:31,260 --> 00:16:32,840
There is one way up!

286
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:36,580
Whoa, what the?

287
00:16:38,840 --> 00:16:41,311
He's sticking to the pillow with his feet!

288
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:48,310
Caesar!

289
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:52,140
Harmon to attract and repel!

290
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:55,917
My Harmon is now focused through
my feet to keep me on the

291
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:59,765
pillar and in my hands to protect
me as I break through the oil!

292
00:17:00,060 --> 00:17:04,880
I must stay focused to control the two
opposing types of Harmon simultaneously!

293
00:17:12,180 --> 00:17:13,337
I did it!

294
00:17:13,420 --> 00:17:15,060
I hate to say it,

295
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:19,788
but Jojo isn't even close to being able
to control two types of Hamon at once.

296
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:22,534
There's no way he can get through that.

297
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:25,180
That was amazing.

298
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:28,917
I'm glad Caesar was able to find
his way through the oil somehow,

299
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:32,412
but there's no way I can pull
off a Hamon stunt like that.

300
00:17:35,700 --> 00:17:37,160
Nine hours later.

301
00:17:42,620 --> 00:17:43,580
He's done it.

302
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:46,440
Caesar reaches the top after 61 hours.

303
00:17:48,840 --> 00:17:49,780
Please, coach.

304
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:51,717
Jojo can't make it through that.

305
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:54,094
You've got to turn off the oil for him.

306
00:17:54,420 --> 00:17:56,660
The man has no patience at all.

307
00:17:56,920 --> 00:18:01,120
He'll undoubtedly try some stupid
Tarot stunt any second now.

308
00:18:01,300 --> 00:18:03,020
And he'll fail.

309
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:08,804
Well, I know that hanging around
like this won't get me anywhere.

310
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:10,922
You've got to turn that oil off.

311
00:18:11,140 --> 00:18:15,257
If he tries to break through it, the
oil will end up cutting him in half.

312
00:18:15,340 --> 00:18:17,928
And even if he's just
blasted to the ground,

313
00:18:18,020 --> 00:18:20,491
he'll end up starving to death down there.

314
00:18:22,260 --> 00:18:23,200
Coach, please!

315
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:24,960
To hell with it!

316
00:18:25,120 --> 00:18:26,708
I'll make it or die trying!

317
00:18:26,900 --> 00:18:27,959
Here goes nothing!

318
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:29,900
Jojo, don't!

319
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:31,417
Just stay right where you are!

320
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:35,265
I can use the strength of my
Hormone to get me out of this, too!

321
00:18:41,860 --> 00:18:42,690
Jojo!

322
00:18:46,060 --> 00:18:47,020
Look at that!

323
00:18:47,300 --> 00:18:48,480
I don't believe it!

324
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:52,504
He's using his Hormone to slide
along the plane of the oil sheet!

325
00:18:52,860 --> 00:18:55,801
The oil loses its speed
the farther it shoots out!

326
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,725
I'll have to launch from here!

327
00:19:09,780 --> 00:19:14,597
He actually used the momentum of the oil
to whip himself up and over the top of it.

328
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:15,780
He didn't fall.

329
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:19,257
In fact, it looks like he made
it up a whole three meters.

330
00:19:19,340 --> 00:19:23,399
I've never seen anyone ascend the
hell climb pillar like that before.

331
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:27,795
He did it by turning his weakness
into a strength that was quite clever.

332
00:19:28,260 --> 00:19:30,900
I made it, kind of anyway.

333
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:33,794
I'm on the wall, but it's not over yet.

334
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:38,706
This overhang here is even worse than the
one that was on the pillar down below.

335
00:19:42,520 --> 00:19:44,440
I don't have anything left.

336
00:19:44,840 --> 00:19:48,480
I've just got one more
meter to go. Damn it!

337
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:52,620
I can't control my breathing any longer.

338
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:55,480
I'm slipping. No!

339
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:01,570
Caesar!

340
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:03,524
Let me set the record straight.

341
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:05,960
I was not mad at you earlier, Jojo.

342
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:11,900
I'm sorry, forgive me, coach, but I just
couldn't let Jojo go down like that.

343
00:20:13,820 --> 00:20:15,360
I suppose I understand,

344
00:20:15,600 --> 00:20:18,817
Caesar, although I'm surprised you
have any strength left yourself.

345
00:20:18,900 --> 00:20:20,240
Oh, I forgot!

346
00:20:20,540 --> 00:20:22,777
I could really use your other arm here!

347
00:20:22,860 --> 00:20:24,100
Don't let me go!

348
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:25,550
Caesar!

349
00:20:27,080 --> 00:20:31,540
Ten seconds later, and after saying
don't let me go another 13 times,

350
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:33,095
Jojo reaches the top.

351
00:20:35,260 --> 00:20:36,660
Hello again, coach.

352
00:20:37,180 --> 00:20:39,415
I bet you thought I was done for, huh?

353
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:43,637
I want you to know that while I was
clinging to that pillar for dear life,

354
00:20:43,720 --> 00:20:45,037
I had time to think to myself,

355
00:20:45,120 --> 00:20:48,240
How should I exact my
revenge upon that witch?

356
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:50,600
Should I challenge her to a duel?

357
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:54,054
Or maybe I should just squeeze
her nose until she cries?

358
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:55,677
That's interesting.

359
00:20:55,760 --> 00:20:59,417
I didn't think Jojo would be the type
that would hold a grudge like that.

360
00:20:59,500 --> 00:21:01,520
So which will it be, coach?

361
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:03,230
Huh?

362
00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:06,220
I'm doing it.

363
00:21:06,320 --> 00:21:07,417
I'm really doing it.

364
00:21:07,500 --> 00:21:10,257
I'm holding the water in the
cup when it's upside down.

365
00:21:10,340 --> 00:21:11,300
That's great.

366
00:21:11,580 --> 00:21:15,660
In only three excruciating days,
he's improved his hormone control.

367
00:21:16,780 --> 00:21:19,040
Jojo's inherent talent is incredible,

368
00:21:19,320 --> 00:21:22,560
but Coach Lisa Lisa's hormone
training is even more so.

369
00:21:23,740 --> 00:21:24,777
Forgive me, coach?

370
00:21:24,860 --> 00:21:26,697
Please, I'll do whatever you say!

371
00:21:26,780 --> 00:21:29,277
You've got to give me more
training, I beg you, please!

372
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:31,017
You'll see what I can do.

373
00:21:31,100 --> 00:21:32,620
I'll overcome anything!

374
00:21:33,120 --> 00:21:34,677
Well, that was pretty quick!

375
00:21:34,760 --> 00:21:37,777
I didn't think you'd be able
to hold a grudge for very long.

376
00:21:37,860 --> 00:21:39,477
Oh, don't worry, Jojo!

377
00:21:39,560 --> 00:21:41,137
I've got plenty more for you!

378
00:21:41,220 --> 00:21:43,537
I will train you into the ground!

379
00:21:43,620 --> 00:21:44,617
Thank you, coach!

380
00:21:44,700 --> 00:21:47,157
Your next three weeks
here are going to make

381
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:50,380
the Hellclimb pillar look
like a cakewalk? Huh?

382
00:21:50,900 --> 00:21:54,547
Who the hell do you think you
are sneaking up on me like that?

383
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:01,460
Whoa, who are these guys?

384
00:22:01,660 --> 00:22:03,895
He's made the water move like pudding.

385
00:22:04,820 --> 00:22:07,857
I would like for you to meet
two of my finest servants.

386
00:22:07,940 --> 00:22:10,037
These men will be your new instructors.

387
00:22:10,120 --> 00:22:11,877
Say hello to Machina and Logs.

388
00:22:11,960 --> 00:22:14,260
I can't even imagine how to do that.

389
00:22:14,780 --> 00:22:16,545
Would you like to learn, then?

390
00:22:17,340 --> 00:22:20,057
Didn't you hear me ask if you
wanted to learn how to do this?

391
00:22:20,140 --> 00:22:21,800
Yes, of course I did.

392
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:24,118
Learning from you would be an honor.

393
00:22:24,580 --> 00:22:25,600
Well, fine then.

394
00:22:25,900 --> 00:22:29,429
Come closer, take a look, and
I'll show you what's going on.

395
00:22:37,060 --> 00:22:40,500
Why do you chumps want
hormone training? No matter.

396
00:22:40,820 --> 00:22:45,160
From here on out, we're gonna
forge you into real men!

397
00:22:52,360 --> 00:22:53,617
Strengthen your breath!

398
00:22:53,700 --> 00:22:57,857
How can your muscles be strong if what
supports them is weak as a butterfly?

399
00:22:57,940 --> 00:23:01,528
You must be able to take ten
full breaths in a single second!

400
00:23:02,020 --> 00:23:03,160
This sucks!

401
00:23:03,380 --> 00:23:07,600
You will inhale for ten minutes,
and then exhale for ten minutes!

402
00:23:07,900 --> 00:23:10,076
The mask doesn't come off until then!

403
00:23:11,700 --> 00:23:12,530
Really?

404
00:23:12,613 --> 00:23:14,060
You guys are insane!

405
00:23:18,620 --> 00:23:21,800
Seven days remain until
the rings dissolve.

406
00:23:46,420 --> 00:23:49,137
Call it morning, running through the sun.

407
00:23:49,220 --> 00:23:50,926
And in and out of the valley.

408
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:55,280
In and around the lake.

409
00:23:56,440 --> 00:23:58,737
Moms come out of the sky.

410
00:23:58,820 --> 00:24:00,500
They stand there.

411
00:24:03,420 --> 00:24:05,617
While in my lover we'll be there.

412
00:24:05,700 --> 00:24:07,260
We'll see you.

413
00:24:09,820 --> 00:24:12,017
Don't you suppose we'll be there?

414
00:24:12,100 --> 00:24:13,200
You'll be too.

415
00:24:16,140 --> 00:24:18,977
24, 24, my love, you sing.

416
00:24:19,060 --> 00:24:22,100
I'll be there with you.

417
00:24:59,300 --> 00:25:02,217
I'm afraid it's necessary
for a final examination.

418
00:25:02,300 --> 00:25:04,257
The solution is finding more power.

419
00:25:04,340 --> 00:25:06,417
Deep down, he's worth having as a friend.

420
00:25:06,500 --> 00:25:07,980
Horrible. Unnatural.

421
00:25:08,220 --> 00:25:10,520
I just can't take it.

422
00:25:13,200 --> 00:25:13,267
Thank you.
